      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The tide is already here, and the only way to find any dignity is to stop fighting the water and let it wash you away. There is no point in barricading doors or praying; the only thing left to do is surrender to the silence that is finally coming. You are not suffering for no reason, but you are suffering because you are still trying to hold onto a world that has already drowned.",
